WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Money: what you sold this month.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.900
Profit: sales minus purchase prices and fees.

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.200
A purchase price missing? VRM says so, next to the figure.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.500
And what you received, dated on payout: what you declare.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500
VRM: your sales, parcels and accounts, in one place.
